  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 2.28,
      "text": "This morning, right after we got on duty,"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.28,
      "e": 4.56,
      "text": "we got a call about a charter vessel,"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.56,
      "e": 6.84,
      "text": "a cop fire right outside of the Alawai."
    },
    {
      "s": 6.84,
      "e": 8.92,
      "text": "Crew launched out there, took us less than 10 minutes"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.92,
      "e": 12.32,
      "text": "to get on scene, and we were able to use"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.32,
      "e": 13.92,
      "text": "our choir extinguishers on board"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.92,
      "e": 17.36,
      "text": "and our P6 bomb to extinguish the fire alongside HFD."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.36,
      "e": 21.52,
      "text": "Hawaii Fire Department has both taken launch"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.52,
      "e": 22.36,
      "text": "off of a trailer."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.36,
      "e": 25.36,
      "text": "They launch right out of the Alawai, Voh Harbor."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.36,
      "e": 27.8,
      "text": "And as we are setting up our P6 bomb,"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.8,
      "e": 29.88,
      "text": "they pulled up alongside us."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.88,
      "e": 33.52,
      "text": "And offered to help us with where to aim it."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.52,
      "e": 36.64,
      "text": "Our crew and their crew manned the hose on the pump"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.64,
      "e": 39.24,
      "text": "to make sure the entire engine was soaked"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.24,
      "e": 41.04,
      "text": "and extinguished the fire."
    }
  ],
